  "steps": [
    "Filling: beat the cream cheese, sugar and vanilla until fluffy, scoop 20 flattened 2-tsp discs onto parchment and freeze.",
    "Jam: cook the blueberries and sugar over medium heat for about 40 minutes, mashing halfway and stirring constantly at the end, until thick. Chill.",
    "Heat the oven to 175 °C. Whisk the flour, baking powder, baking soda and salt.",
    "Rub the lemon zest into the sugar, cream with the butter until very fluffy, then beat in the egg and vanilla and mix in the dry ingredients.",
    "Layer the dough with the jam in quarters and fold just enough to leave pockets of jam.",
    "Scoop 20 portions, wrap each around a frozen cheesecake disc, roll in sugar and bake 6 at a time for 11–12 minutes. Cool on the sheet for 10 minutes."
  ],
